                        "entry_id": "c8b87a44-d874-300f-a5d9-395d0db11c91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "number of digits (in a given numeric value written in decimal or other positional notation)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "771073b5-c585-32f0-95c3-f92dc926637e",
                        "entry_id": "c8b87a44-d874-300f-a5d9-395d0db11c91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bitness, bit width, word size, word length (the size in bits of the natural unit of data processed by a given CPU or transferred over a given bus)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fbf8998c-de22-36fd-bccb-a852b51a22cf",
                        "entry_id": "c8b87a44-d874-300f-a5d9-395d0db11c91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bit depth, resolution (of digitized data, in bits)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "943c0841-0e94-409f-8e00-2b884370d5d8",
                                "sense_id": "fbf8998c-de22-36fd-bccb-a852b51a22cf",
                                "text": "Перево́дится он «в ци́фру» и обра́тно с по́мощью ана́лого-цифровы́х и ци́фро-ана́логовых преобразова́телей (АЦП и ЦАП). Чем бо́льше разря́дность таки́х устро́йств, тем вы́ше ка́чество преобразова́ния. Ска́жем, ста́рые звуковы́е ка́рты компью́теров име́ли разря́дность 8 бит.",
                                "translation": "It's transformed to digital form and back using analog-to-digital and digital-to-analog converters (ADC and DAC). The greater the bit depth of these devices, the higher the quality of the conversion. For instance, old computer sound cards had a resolution of 8 bits.",
                                "english": "It's transformed to digital form and back using analog-to-digital and digital-to-analog converters (ADC and DAC). The greater the bit depth of these devices, the higher the quality of the conversion. For instance, old computer sound cards had a resolution of 8 bits."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
